  "goodToKnow": "Nennenswert means significant or worth mentioning, usually in negative statements: keine nennenswerten Schäden (no significant damage), nicht nennenswert. It's typical of news and reports. The suffix -wert (worth) forms many adjectives: sehenswert (worth seeing), lesenswert, empfehlenswert (recommendable), lebenswert (worth living), bemerkenswert (remarkable)."
